## Additional Attribution

This project incorporates components from the following open-source projects:

### Drain Log Parser
- Source: https://github.com/logpai/logparser
- License: MIT License
- Citation: He, P., Zhu, J., Zheng, Z., & Lyu, M. R. (2017). Drain: An online log parsing approach with fixed depth tree. Proceedings of the 2017 International Conference on Web Services (ICWS).

### BERT Architecture
- Source: Inspired by Google's BERT implementation
- Citation: Devlin, J., Chang, M. W., Lee, K., & Toutanova, K. (2018). BERT: Pre-training of Deep Bidirectional Transformers for Language Understanding. arXiv preprint arXiv:1810.04805.

### Hadoop Log Dataset
- Source: LogHub (https://github.com/logpai/loghub)
- Citation: Zhu, J., He, S., Liu, J., He, P., Xie, Q., Zheng, Z., & Lyu, M. R. (2019). Tools and benchmarks for automated log parsing. In Proceedings of the 41st International Conference on Software Engineering: Software Engineering in Practice (pp. 121-130).

### Deep SVDD
- Inspiration: Deep Support Vector Data Description
- Citation: Ruff, L., Vandermeulen, R., Goernitz, N., Deecke, L., Siddiqui, S. A., Binder, A., ... & Kloft, M. (2018). Deep one-class classification. In International conference on machine learning (pp. 4393-4402).

